<BaseLayout title="Creator Workflow"><article class="prose shell"><div class="eyebrow">Workflow</div><h1>Make the work legible.</h1><p class="lede">Creator’s loop is simple enough to remember and specific enough to use.</p><h2>01 Plan</h2><p>Name the audience, intent, and one useful outcome.</p><h2>02 Shape</h2><p>Choose the format, title direction, sections, and examples.</p><h2>03 Make</h2><p>Draft, record, design, or edit with the promise visible.</p><h2>04 Check</h2><p>Use a preflight for content, accessibility, links, and mobile context.</p><h2>05 Learn</h2><p>Keep one observation for the next piece, not a dashboard of vanity metrics.</p></article></BaseLayout>
